{"content_hash": "53520ac126637fcd", "version_id": 972, "article_id": 98, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Chinese stocks fall as robot and health themes cool", "title_zh": "机器人、医疗概念退潮，A股大跌", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8205442.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517422688858-c17ab068121c?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8Y2hpbmElMjBzdG9ja3MlMjBmYWxsfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ3MDUwOTl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Kido Dong on Unsplash", "author": "Kido Dong", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@likeakid?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/panoramic-photography-of-cn-tower-toronto-canada-1wZ5i0yhHiA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(193, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(231, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "efd1712d6bc7"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-15", "word_count": 129, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "On November 13, most Chinese stocks fell. Three companies hit their lowest price limit. All three had high prices because of popular stories, not strong business.", "lead_zh": "11月13日，A股大多数股票下跌。三家公司的股价跌停。这三家股价此前很高，靠的是热门题材，而不是强劲的业务。", "preview": "The Shanghai index fell 0.59% to 3634.35. The ChiNext index dropped 3.32%. About 4,748 stocks went down, and 39 hit the daily limit. Nvidia'", "preview_zh": "上证指数下跌0.59%，收于3634.35点。创业板指下跌3.32%。约4748只股票下跌，39只跌停。英伟达CEO的消息也打击了科技股。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 955, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 52.375, "size_bytes": 315216, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 151, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@8e70455/content/data/versions/972.json", "paragraphs": ["The Shanghai index fell 0.59% to 3634.35. The ChiNext index dropped 3.32%. About 4,748 stocks went down, and 39 hit the daily limit. Nvidia's CEO news also hurt tech shares.", "Nanwei makes bandages and masks. Its stock rose on flu and mask stories. But the company lost money this year, and its sales fell. Its price is still about twice its fair value.", "Xiangyang Bearing makes car parts. Its stock jumped on robot stories. The company said its robot business brings almost no money. After eight strong days, the stock closed at the limit.", "Daye makes steel wire for tires. Its stock rose on a robot rope idea. But the rope is only being tested. Daye lost 116 million yuan this year. Its shares fell to the limit too."], "paragraphs_zh": ["上证指数下跌0.59%，收于3634.35点。创业板指下跌3.32%。约4748只股票下跌，39只跌停。英伟达CEO的消息也打击了科技股。", "南卫股份生产创可贴和口罩。流感与口罩题材推动其股价上涨。但公司今年亏损，收入下滑。其股价仍约为合理价值的两倍。", "襄阳轴承生产汽车零件。机器人题材推动其股价大涨。公司表示机器人业务几乎不赚钱。连续八个涨停后，该股跌停。", "大业股份生产轮胎用钢丝。一根机器人绳子的想法推高了股价。但这根绳子还在测试中。大业今年亏损1.16亿元。其股价同样跌停。"], "body": "The Shanghai index fell 0.59% to 3634.35. The ChiNext index dropped 3.32%. About 4,748 stocks went down, and 39 hit the daily limit. Nvidia's CEO news also hurt tech shares.\n\nNanwei makes bandages and masks. Its stock rose on flu and mask stories. But the company lost money this year, and its sales fell. Its price is still about twice its fair value.\n\nXiangyang Bearing makes car parts. Its stock jumped on robot stories. The company said its robot business brings almost no money. After eight strong days, the stock closed at the limit.\n\nDaye makes steel wire for tires. Its stock rose on a robot rope idea. But the rope is only being tested. Daye lost 116 million yuan this year. Its shares fell to the limit too.", "body_zh": "上证指数下跌0.59%，收于3634.35点。创业板指下跌3.32%。约4748只股票下跌，39只跌停。英伟达CEO的消息也打击了科技股。\n\n南卫股份生产创可贴和口罩。流感与口罩题材推动其股价上涨。但公司今年亏损，收入下滑。其股价仍约为合理价值的两倍。\n\n襄阳轴承生产汽车零件。机器人题材推动其股价大涨。公司表示机器人业务几乎不赚钱。连续八个涨停后，该股跌停。\n\n大业股份生产轮胎用钢丝。一根机器人绳子的想法推高了股价。但这根绳子还在测试中。大业今年亏损1.16亿元。其股价同样跌停。", "text": "The Shanghai index fell 0.59% to 3634.35. The ChiNext index dropped 3.32%. About 4,748 stocks went down, and 39 hit the daily limit. Nvidia's CEO news also hurt tech shares. Nanwei makes bandages and masks. Its stock rose on flu and mask stories. But the company lost money this year, and its sales fell. Its price is still about twice its fair value. Xiangyang Bearing makes car parts. Its stock jumped on robot stories. The company said its robot business brings almost no money. After eight strong days, the stock closed at the limit. Daye makes steel wire for tires. Its stock rose on a robot rope idea. But the rope is only being tested. Daye lost 116 million yuan this year. Its shares fell to the limit too.", "vocab": [{"word": "stock", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股票", "note": "常用复数 stocks 表示股票", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fall", "pos": "verb", "zh": "下跌", "note": "过去式 fell", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "index", "pos": "noun", "zh": "指数", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "drop", "pos": "verb", "zh": "下降", "note": "比 fall 更口语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "limit", "pos": "noun", "zh": "涨停/跌停", "note": "hit the daily limit 指涨跌停", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lose money", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "亏损", "note": "过去式 lost money", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sales", "pos": "noun", "zh": "销售额", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "test", "pos": "verb", "zh": "测试", "note": "be tested 被测试", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-15T01:11:22.487134", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.362, "sm": 275, "em": 362, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Shanghai", "s": 0.362, "e": 0.75, "sm": 362, "em": 750, "cs": 4, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "index", "s": 0.75, "e": 1.15, "sm": 750, "em": 1149, "cs": 13, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "fell", "s": 1.15, "e": 1.387, "sm": 1150, "em": 1387, "cs": 19, "ce": 23, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "0.59